    "data": "<h1 style=\"margin: 16px 0; font-size: 26px !important;\">Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1euAPePE1y/\" target=\"_blank\">舞动吧中国</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/14d2f2502d359d54dc8fb9cf8c65aca53546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GADYYmEnd/\" target=\"_blank\">俄罗斯方块</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/7062f67230c1dce77124b91203dc0c723546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oG9zY1EKy/\" target=\"_blank\">花瓣、与之相关的声音</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/636572e3dbde725d49c5dc72d3e9fdc73546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y9iZYUE6y/\" target=\"_blank\">就来面对 Nice try</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8d6fd9239a5c2005a50bc5ecde3ce2e93546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sM4y1V7x1/\" target=\"_blank\">千本樱</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f3f81c4bc55aa81ea1c9a40c4343b7423546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hs411W7uR/\" target=\"_blank\">妄想感伤代偿联盟</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/9cf98ecfa099063f6f1a3eaa02972ca73546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nafnYUEac/\" target=\"_blank\">医学</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/602f52bd94777f8efbc185e5f559f7873546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dx421Q7CM/\" target=\"_blank\">虚荣屠夫</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a24548bc1fa7b00fb9ea71dce9430d35a0e9c8fe.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 12 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oC411572T/\" target=\"_blank\">死别</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cdf83836a76bddc46c63cfeff8e745755a5882de.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 11 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nvKnewEcU/\" target=\"_blank\">超级主角</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a96015ca8705340b1fa9b6ba33ba311f668c8fbc.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 10 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cJ411q7GF/\" target=\"_blank\">春岚</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4d6e243e00a415e5fcc460ef3c2b9f31fe37d7c8.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 9 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uJ411879Y/\" target=\"_blank\">神的随波逐流</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7151a1406fce8281694bc35cee009833639b0a9a.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 8 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cZw9eDERz/\" target=\"_blank\">心灵感应</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/826baf719c85b58d48aac2587773a6b7354